# Response templates for the error-driven repair loop (issue #1185).
#
# The loop's honest stops render through these records so no repair prose
# lives in Rust. Placeholders in braces are filled by the handler.

multilingual_responses
  response response_repair_ladder_exhausted_en
    intent repair_ladder_exhausted
    language en
    text "The error-driven repair loop climbed rung {rung} of at most {max_rungs} without resolving the failure, so it stopped here instead of retrying without a bound. Each rung formalized the diagnostic, searched its text, and retained only a fix a fetched source stated for the exact error; the failure report above stands as the honest outcome."
  response response_repair_unresolved_need_en
    intent repair_unresolved_need
    language en
    text "The diagnostic search ({query}) found no fetched source that addresses this exact error, so no candidate fix was retained. This is an unresolved need, reported as such rather than guessed."
